    "description": "<p>Careful aim begets a better shot. Following a target with her eyes and her weapon, the Exalt uses Essence to help steady her arm and focus her sight. Invoking this Charm after three ticks of the Aim action increases the maximum bonus from aiming by three. The Exalt may then take another Aim action and gain a greater bonus to her shot. Other than increasing the maximum bonus, this Charm does not change the way the Aim action works.</p>",
